==Battleground==
*1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*2 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*2 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
There are a lot of [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies in this stage, so make sure to bring some [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] cats. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Weightlifter Cat]] is definitely recommended, as well as [[Tin Cat (Rare Cat)|Tin Cat]] or [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] to [[Knockback|knockback]] and/or [[Freeze|freeze]] Director Kurosawah, who is the boss of this stage. Remember to bring a [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|critical hitter]] to deal with the HaterBaa 2.0s early on. [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] helps due to his crazy fast attack rate and his 5% chance to perform a [[Critical Hit]], so as long as your meatshields and anti-Dark units are leveled up decently, it shouldn't be too hard. After you kill the Dark Otter, you have pretty much won as Director Kurosawah alone is not a threat.

